  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity strengthening for Caritas International regional member organisations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As the Regional Secretariat for the Middle East North Africa region, Caritas MONA seeks to accompany ad build the capacity of the 15 Caritas International Member Organisations (MOs) in the region.  According to the new Strategic Plan 2024-27 Caritas MONA will support the MOs especially in the areas of interreligious and ecumenical collaboration, promoting the role of women and youth, and integral ecology, and generally to achieve professional standards. CAFOD wishes to support Caritas MONA as a regional partner to continue its valuable work during 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
